      "_note": "composed by regression/scenarios/composer.py — targets: cm-account-resource. LIVE-VERIFIED (run 2026-06-18): getaccountproductlist REQUIRES the X-ResourceType header — without it the backend 400s 'InvalidHeaderValue' naming param resourceType / X-ResourceType. The header is undocumented (not in api_docs getaccountproductlist params) but mandatory — the earlier 'header was an invention, remove it' correction was a hypothesis the live call disproved. X-ResourceType:INSTANCE is accepted by the header validator (no more 400) but returns 404 ResourceNotFound on this account (error param hints the value should be a productCategoryCode and/or there is no INSTANCE-category monitored resource — the documented fail-fast when no Running VM is registered). 404 is therefore tolerated (records GET coverage) and capture is soft so the dependent read skips cleanly instead of false-failing.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "create-cm-account-resource",
          "service": "cloudmonitoring",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/cloudmonitorings/product/v2/accounts/products",
          "headers": {
            "X-ResourceType": "INSTANCE"
          },
          "expect_status": [
            200,
            201,
            202,
            404
          ],
          "capture_soft": {
            "product_resource_id": {
              "list": "$.contents",
              "where_prefix": {
                "productResourceId": "INSTANCE-"
              },
              "get": "productResourceId"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verify-cm-account-resource-read",
